  "goodToKnow": "Das Wahlergebnis is an election result. On German election nights, at 18:00 sharp ARD and ZDF publish the Prognose (exit poll), followed by Hochrechnungen (projections) through the evening, then the vorläufiges Endergebnis (provisional result) overnight, and later the amtliches Endergebnis. The Bundeswahlleiterin oversees federal elections. Parties need at least 5 percent (Fünfprozenthürde) to enter the Bundestag. Plural: die Wahlergebnisse."
